the substances detected in the oral fluid.<\/p>"}},"question_b7CdmW":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"What drugs can a saliva drug test kit detect?","text":"<p>Drug test kits from Andatech such as the best selling <a href=\"https:\/\/andatech.com.au\/products\/drugsense-dso8-plus\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"DSO8+ saliva drug test kit\">DrugSense DSO8+<\/a> can detect up to eight different drug groups in a single oral sample.<\/p><p>These drug groups include marijuana (THC), amphetamines, synthetic marijuana, cocaine, methamphetamines, opiates, and more.<\/p>"}},"question_YJYUjL":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Are saliva drug test kits legal in Australia?","text":"<p>Saliva drug test kits are not only legal but drug testing is made mandatory in many safety sensitive industries.<\/p>"}},"question_kNFNwa":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Can a saliva drug test kit detect recent drug use?","text":"<p>Saliva drug test kits are preferred for their ability to detect recent drug use, usually up to 48 hours since last use.<\/p><p>Read more: <a href=\"https:\/\/andatech.com.au\/blogs\/resources\/how-long-do-drugs-stay-in-your-system\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"How long do drugs stay in your system?\">How long do drugs stay in your system?<\/a><\/p>"}},"question_KqKJjT":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"How long does it take to get results from a saliva drug test kit?","text":"<p>Saliva drug test kits deliver results in as fast as 10 minutes once an oral sample has been collected. Please refer to each product's respective user manuals for exact specifications.<\/p>"}},"question_FncCD4":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Can a saliva drug test kit be used in the workplace?","text":"<p>Yes, saliva drug test kits are commonly used in the workplace due to their many advantages including speed of testing and convenience.<\/p><p>Read more: <a href=\"https:\/\/andatech.com.au\/blogs\/resources\/why-mining-companies-are-turning-to-saliva-drug-test-kits\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Why mining companies are turning to saliva drug test kits\">Why mining companies are turning to saliva drug test kits<\/a><\/p>"}}},"block_order":["question_T9yX6j","question_NjxPTd","question_b7CdmW","question_YJYUjL","question_kNFNwa","question_KqKJjT","question_FncCD4"],"settings":{"heading":"Saliva Drug Test Kit FAQs","heading_align":"text-center","color_scheme":"none","full_width":true}}},"order":["rich_text_eiXhdd","collection-banner","featured_product_eEhtQK","icons_with_text_HiiPgV","collection-products","faq_6Ac96M"]}